# The Stitch export archive — the unpacked folder next to it is what we read.
docs/*.zip

# Build output. Committed once by accident and it cost this repo 3.4 GB:
# `desktop/relay/target` alone was 3,809 files of Rust debug binaries, which
# made `git push` time out against GitHub with HTTP 408 and took the whole
# product history offline. Both directories are regenerated — `cargo build`
# and desktop/packaging/Build-Package.ps1 — and neither belongs in history.
desktop/relay/target/
desktop/packaging/dist/
